# Every variable here is optional. The site builds and runs with none set.

# Form delivery. The forms post to Web3Forms from the browser, and each
# submission is emailed to the address the access key was CREATED with. The
# site's key is written into src/lib/web3forms.ts, because Web3Forms keys are
# public by design. Set this only to use a different key, for example one
# generated with a different recipient address.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=""

# Microsoft Clarity project id. Clarity stays off until this is set. Publish a
# privacy notice the same day: Clarity records sessions and sets cookies.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLARITY_PROJECT_ID=""

# Public site origin, for canonical URLs, Open Graph and the sitemap. Leave
# unset until Nkrabea's domain is live: while it is unset the site is noindex,
# so a vercel.app address never competes with the real one.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=""
